00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,700
That's a direct order!

252
00:15:42,340 --> 00:15:48,200
Ah, my eyes, help me, please
call somebody, father.

253
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:51,291
I need medical attention.

254
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:57,220
83, 89, 97, if you want
me, I'm right here.

255
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,460
Just open the door.

256
00:15:59,780 --> 00:16:02,337
You must know if I'm able to
leave here and call for help,

257
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:04,361
you can get treatment right away.

258
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:06,997
That is what you were thinking, is it not?

259
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:11,845
If so, why would you not make it a priority
to move in the direction of my voice?

260
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:17,250
Father!

261
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:24,000
The disc that contains
Shotaro Kujo Star Platinum.

262
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:27,057
Exactly what should I do about it now?

263
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:30,317
I took care of Jolene, but I can't
just leave her in the courtyard.

264
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:32,240
Did the gate finally open?

265
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:33,932
Please take me with you!

266
00:16:34,660 --> 00:16:38,500
Who? Father? Hello? Father? Where are you?

267
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:41,737
This is my limit.

268
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:44,140
I can't hold back the poison anymore.

269
00:16:44,460 --> 00:16:45,960
And I dropped the disc.

270
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:48,120
I don't even know where it is.

271
00:17:04,220 --> 00:17:09,657
The rain has stopped but where is

272
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:13,537
Jolene Kujo's lifeless body if I find her

273
00:17:13,620 --> 00:17:18,777
I should find the disc I was frightened
there for a moment but there's no way

274
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:25,577
frogs can defeat a snake search for it
palesnake's range of movement is barely

275
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:30,500
20 meters at best I'm running a huge
risk by even being here if someone sees?

276
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:34,200
tells me all bets are off,
but there's no other way.

277
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:42,297
The soul of a deceased criminal
returns to Earth in the form of a frog

278
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:46,097
in the name of trying to bring its
companions to the land of the dead.

279
00:17:46,180 --> 00:17:49,797
I have heard that in the East there
are stories of a similar nature,

280
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:53,468
but this horror is truly the
personification of that proverb.

281
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:57,431
Nonetheless, the disk I seek
must be around here somewhere.

282
00:17:58,540 --> 00:17:59,577
Listen, Pale Snake.

283
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:03,837
I want you to sweep the area between where
you are and the entrance to the gate.

284
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:06,038
The guard may have taken it earlier.

285
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:07,964
It should be in that direction.

286
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:11,500
Ah, here it is!

287
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:16,260
I have retrieved the disc.

288
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:18,040
Thanks a lot.

289
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:21,105
I've been waiting for
you to find where it was.

290
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:38,360
This is so gross, they're all over
my face, makes me want to throw up.

291
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:42,577
The poison only comes out when
the frogs splatter on impact,

292
00:18:42,660 --> 00:18:45,131
so if they don't explode they're harmless.

293
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:48,017
That's why I made a
net using live frogs in

294
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:50,747
order to lessen the
impact of the frogs still

295
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:55,160
falling, which allowed me to lay
in wait for you to locate the disk.

296
00:18:56,020 --> 00:18:57,680
It doesn't matter!

297
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,500
You lost!

298
00:19:00,780 --> 00:19:02,300
Accept your fate and die!

299
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:14,180
Actually, it was already here.

300
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:17,217
The Speedwagon Foundation's
messenger wasn't human.

301
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:21,600
You just didn't even see that
it was here right on time,

302
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:24,237
weaving through the deadly
rain of frogs like an angel.

303
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:26,026
It made it to this courtyard.

304
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:28,857
Savage Guardian is the
name of that pigeon.

305
00:19:28,940 --> 00:19:33,822
And like all trained carrier pigeons, it
will bring the disc to its rightful place.

306
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:37,430
Hail Snake!

307
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:40,717
The gun that the guard dropped
earlier is still over near the gate!

308
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:42,565
Blow that bird out of the sky!

309
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:47,380
Ugh, idiotic guard!

310
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,617
He completely emptied the clip of bullets!

311
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:50,530
Damn it!

312
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,960
I won.

313
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:57,037
Don't underestimate me, you insolent brat!

314
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,597
This changes nothing.

315
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,637
Even with Star Platinum returned,

316
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:02,797
Your father would be nothing
more than a broken puppet.

317
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:05,977
He will never be able to recognize
you as his own daughter again.

318
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:08,037
This little game is over!

319
00:20:08,120 --> 00:20:10,937
Hey look, there's a guard
knocked out over there.

320
00:20:11,020 --> 00:20:12,757
Don't step on the frauds.

321
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:13,670
And check the courtyard.

322
00:20:13,753 --> 00:20:15,267
There might be someone else.

323
00:20:18,140 --> 00:20:19,537
No, not yet.

324
00:20:19,620 --> 00:20:21,280
I can't faint here.

325
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:23,991
The stand user has to be nearby somewhere.

326
00:20:24,800 --> 00:20:27,560
I have to find out who
Pale Snake really is.

327
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:30,900
And the user still has
my father's memory disk.

328
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:35,588
Now's the best chance I'm gonna
get to discover who they are.

329
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:37,930
Hey!

330
00:20:38,013 --> 00:20:39,232
Look outside the window!

331
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:41,220
Oh my god! Unbelievable!

332
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:42,934
It's a bloody miracle!

333
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:45,619
But who's gonna clean up this mess?

334
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:47,337
Nothing has changed at all.

335
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:50,957
The only reason I stole Star
Platinum in the first place was

336
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:54,760
to defeat Jotaro Kujo and avenge
the death of my best friend.

337
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:59,911
What matters most is the memory disk,
and it still remains in my possession.

338
00:21:00,100 --> 00:21:01,980
Everything is going as planned.

339
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:07,049
The instructions on how to reach Heaven
can only be found in Jotaro's memory.

340
00:21:17,420 --> 00:21:19,857
An abnormal occurrence
where frogs rained down

341
00:21:19,940 --> 00:21:22,528
from the sky solely in
the prison courtyard.

342
00:21:26,160 --> 00:21:28,217
Through the chaos of
this unexplainable event,

343
00:21:28,300 --> 00:21:31,065
Jolene's attempt at
escaping went unquestioned.

344
00:21:33,740 --> 00:21:35,681
And thanks to a feathered friend,

345
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:38,137
the Speedwagon Foundation
obtained the disc

346
00:21:38,220 --> 00:21:40,940
which contains Jotaro
Kujo's Star Platinum.

347
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:47,020
However, without the memory disc, Jotaro's
mind and soul will never be restored.

348
00:21:58,700 --> 00:22:02,077
Although you think I cope,

349
00:22:02,160 --> 00:22:07,497
my head is filled with hope.

350
00:22:07,580 --> 00:22:12,117
Of some place

351
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:15,780
other than here?

352
00:22:18,500 --> 00:22:22,160
Although you think I smile

353
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:27,220
Inside and all the while

354
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:35,420
I'm wondering about my destiny.

355
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:39,877
I'm thinking

356
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:45,577
about all the

357
00:22:45,660 --> 00:22:50,437
things I'd like

358
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:56,440
to do in my life.

359
00:22:58,300 --> 00:23:01,320
I'm a dreamer.

360
00:23:02,800 --> 00:23:06,480
A distant dreamer.

361
00:23:08,700 --> 00:23:11,380
Dreaming for all?

362
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:16,520
From today!

363
00:23:21,860 --> 00:23:23,037
Sports Maximum.

364
00:23:23,120 --> 00:23:25,900
This is the bone that I
want to ask you about.

365
00:23:27,220 --> 00:23:28,817
Using your unique abilities,

366
00:23:28,900 --> 00:23:32,097
there is something I
would like to try really

367
00:23:32,180 --> 00:23:35,797
does that belong to a
human whose bone is it?

368
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:37,697
That answer is none of your business.

369
00:23:37,780 --> 00:23:40,477
Let's just say it belongs
to an old friend of mine.

370
00:23:40,560 --> 00:23:43,197
The bone of my dear friend.

371
00:23:43,280 --> 00:23:44,820
The great deal.

372
00:23:55,900 --> 00:23:56,730
Thank you.

373
00:24:27,740 --> 00:24:29,180
Thank you.
